The unit used to populate this entry is ver. 1022uk.
"P/N: 141752220000J R0A" is silkscreened on the board in the FCC photos, as well as a retail unit. :An '''Arcadyan''' label is affixed to the back of the board. The non-MAC portion reads '''WN7522A-LF-AK AU'''.
